    "\n",
    "# Método de Newton\n",
    "\n",
    "**Algoritmo 2.3 de Burden — Ejemplo 1**\n",
    "\n",
    "En este ejemplo vamos a encontrar una raíz de la siguiente ecuación:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(x)=\\cos x-x=0\n",
    "$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "da0c3dc9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## 1. Fórmula del método\n",
    "\n",
    "El método de Newton sirve para aproximar una raíz usando la función y su derivada:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "p=p_0-\\frac{f(p_0)}{f'(p_0)}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "En este ejercicio tenemos:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(x)=\\cos x-x,\\qquad f'(x)=-\\sin x-1\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Usaremos $p_0=\\pi/4$ como valor inicial, igual que en el libro. El método se detiene cuando $|p-p_0|<TOL$ o cuando se llega al máximo de iteraciones.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "88ca608d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## 2. Importar las funciones\n",
    "\n",
    "Usamos `cos`, `sin` y `pi` para los cálculos trigonométricos. También importamos `matplotlib` para hacer la gráfica.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "fe737314",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-15T04:52:04.021204Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-15T04:52:04.020980Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.788314Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.787194Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "from math import cos, sin, pi\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dec41ffd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## 3. Definir la función y su derivada\n",
    "\n",
    "Con `def` creamos una función y con `return` indicamos qué resultado debe devolver.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "e4e2f9c5",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.793830Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.793426Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.796917Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.796211Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "def f(x):\n",
    "    return cos(x) - x\n",
    "\n",
    "def derivada(x):\n",
    "    return -sin(x) - 1\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2bb2d54e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## 4. Código del método de Newton\n",
    "\n",
    "En cada iteración se calcula una nueva aproximación. Si la derivada vale cero, el método no puede seguir con ese cálculo.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "78edf702",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.798751Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.798614Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.805003Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.801427Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "def newton(p0, tol, nmax):\n",
    "    datos = []\n",
    "\n",
    "    for i in range(1, nmax + 1):\n",
    "        df = derivada(p0)\n",
    "\n",
    "        if df == 0:\n",
    "            return None, datos, False\n",
    "\n",
    "        p = p0 - f(p0) / df\n",
    "        diferencia = abs(p - p0)\n",
    "        datos.append((i, p, f(p), diferencia))\n",
    "\n",
    "        if diferencia < tol:\n",
    "            return p, datos, True\n",
    "\n",
    "        p0 = p\n",
    "\n",
    "    return p, datos, False\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aae4ccaf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## 5. Resolver el ejemplo\n",
    "\n",
    "Tomamos $p_0=\\pi/4$, una tolerancia de $TOL=10^{-5}$ y un máximo de 100 iteraciones.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "0e8dff1b",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-15T04:52:08.807561Z",
